{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cep7opHQoid9TgRpz95uz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and fully tested. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint with full compliance to the requirements.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n**1. ShipmentController.kt** — Added the confirm endpoint that:\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Moves CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED status\n   - Returns existing CONFIRMED shipments unchanged (idempotent for retries)\n   - Rejects CANCELLED shipments with HTTP 409\n\n**2. ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` error code for state conflicts\n\n**3. ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 4 comprehensive tests:\n   - Confirms a created shipment → status becomes CONFIRMED\n   - Confirm of already-confirmed shipment succeeds (idempotent)\n   - Confirm of non-existent shipment fails with 404\n   - Confirm of cancelled shipment fails with 409\n\n### Test Results\n✅ All 17 tests pass (9 shipment tests including the 4 new ones, plus 4 order, 3 customer, 1 application test)\n✅ Build succeeds with no errors\n✅ Only 3 files modified (controller, error codes, tests) — no unrelated changes\n✅ No new Maven dependencies added\n\nThe implementation follows the existing Spring Boot/Kotlin architecture, uses the established error handling patterns, and is production-ready."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1441,"cache_read_input_tokens":42171,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1441},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4accacf2-cffc-4b3b-ac41-059cd9bb646e","uuid":"698